# Publish ignore (ADR-0111). Its mere PRESENCE makes npm stop consulting the repo `.gitignore`
# when packing — without it, the gitignored `registry-index.json` build artifact (a runtime asset
# the generator reads via `import.meta.url`) is dropped from the tarball even though `package.json`
# `files` lists it (npm/cli#4360). The `files` allowlist is the real selector (ADR-0429); this file
# only neutralizes the `.gitignore`-as-npmignore fallback.
